Look at me. I can't even save my poor citizens.

246
00:19:36,157 --> 00:19:37,717
Please hang in there.

247
00:19:38,397 --> 00:19:42,277
What good is a king's army if it can't even protect the king it serves?

248
00:19:42,697 --> 00:19:44,857
We're an embarrassment to this country!

249
00:19:44,857 --> 00:19:48,297
Siricaros! Just two hours left to the execution!

250
00:19:48,937 --> 00:19:50,817
Come with us to Conchcord Plaza!

251
00:19:51,037 --> 00:19:54,217
What happened to Captain Horty? Is he not with you?

252
00:19:54,577 --> 00:19:57,537
