257
00:20:12,937 --> 00:20:15,657
Captain Horty was injured!

258
00:20:16,097 --> 00:20:19,937
The human pirate swordsman cut him in the gashes too painful to bear!

259
00:20:19,977 --> 00:20:21,777
Injured? The captain got injured?

260
00:20:22,297 --> 00:20:27,097
His body wouldn't stop hurting so he kept taking energy steroids to help kill the pain!

261
00:20:29,777 --> 00:20:31,197
Now he's messed up!

262
00:20:31,197 --> 00:20:33,797
We told him to stop but he wouldn't listen to anyone!

263
00:20:37,797 --> 00:20:38,957
Oh, Captain Horty!

264
00:20:41,357 --> 00:20:42,277
I can't breathe!

265
00:20:42,637 --> 00:20:43,197
I can't...

266
00:20:44,397 --> 00:20:47,157
I feel like I'm gonna explode!

267
00:20:47,157 --> 00:20:48,157
It's just as I suspected!

268
00:20:48,157 --> 00:20:49,157
It's just as I suspected!

269
00:20:49,157 --> 00:20:52,157
The drug side effects are bad enough to kill you!

270
00:20:52,157 --> 00:20:52,757
To kill you!

271
00:20:53,057 --> 00:20:55,557
To kill you!

272
00:20:57,277 --> 00:20:59,117
HUGGHHHGHHHHHHhhh!!!

273
00:21:01,417 --> 00:21:07,217
PURSED

274
00:21:07,637 --> 00:21:08,197
iquing

275
00:21:08,197 --> 00:21:32,857
Whoa, something's wrong.

276
00:21:38,197 --> 00:21:46,197
What's wrong with you now, sea bear?

277
00:21:46,197 --> 00:21:48,197
I think he must be afraid.

278
00:21:48,197 --> 00:21:52,197
But all these sea monsters have been under Captain Horty's control for a really long time now.

279
00:21:52,197 --> 00:21:55,197
I don't know what would spook him so much.

280
00:22:01,197 --> 00:22:03,197
It's at you, Captain!

281
00:22:03,197 --> 00:22:05,197
You doing okay there?

282
00:22:05,197 --> 00:22:07,197
But of course.

283
00:22:07,197 --> 00:22:09,197
And why wouldn't I be?

284
00:22:16,197 --> 00:22:18,197
He's alive, but something changed.

285
00:22:28,197 --> 00:22:30,197
Some of Neptune's soldiers are still alive.

286
00:22:34,197 --> 00:22:35,197
Water shot.

287
00:22:37,197 --> 00:22:38,197
Let's go, Ha!

288
00:22:39,197 --> 00:22:52,197
Honey, terrible!

289
00:22:52,197 --> 00:23:14,457
Neptune's army is crushed by the overwhelming might of the newly transformed Hordi.

290
00:23:14,457 --> 00:23:18,397
The people's last hope lies in the three princes of the Ryugu Kingdom.

291
00:23:18,397 --> 00:23:27,397
Rushing to the scene, they quickly battle Hordi's sea monsters, but his crewmates have a dirty trick up their sleeves that could turn the tables once again.

292
00:23:27,397 --> 00:23:34,397
On the next One Piece, the battle is on at Conchcord Plaza! I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

